# Tauri updater public key: the one line `cargo tauri signer generate` writes into its .pub file
# (tauri.conf.json plugins.updater.pubkey; tauri-release.yml injects it at build time). Public,
# safe to commit. Its private half is the GitHub secret TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY (+ _PASSWORD)
# and never goes into this repository. How: docs/desktop/anahtarlar.md
# Until this line is replaced, tauri-release.yml skips the updater bundle and latest.json.
REPLACE_WITH_TAURI_UPDATER_PUBLIC_KEY
